{
  "abstract": "For every n at least five, every positive hollow symmetric rank-three matrix lies outside the closure of actual complementary coordinate projection-volume arrays. The entry includes its inertia, strict perturbation and unconditional open-family conclusions. For every 1 <= k < n it also records the exact mixed-volume compactification by finite marked segments and the affine-dimension bound, including replacement of every marked representation.",
